                        <p><strong>civilian casualties</strong> <em>(tinch aholi qurbonlari)</em> — non-military people killed or injured in war</p>
                        <p><strong>weaponry</strong> <em>(qurollar)</em> — weapons collectively</p>
                        <p><strong>escalate</strong> <em>(kuchaymoq)</em> — to increase in intensity or seriousness</p>
